OL,3,GNEWSALord Advocate 'concerned' as
OL,4,Adomestic abuse charges rise by 14%
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's top law officer has said it
OL,7,Fis "concerning for all of us" that the
OL,8,Fnumber of domestic abuse charges has
OL,9,Fincreased.
OL,11,FNew figures show that 34,586 charges
OL,12,Fwere reported to the Crown Office and
OL,13,FProcurator Fiscal Service (COPFS) last
OL,14,Fyear - an increase of 14% on the
OL,15,Fprevious year. Court action was ordered
OL,16,Fin 91% of cases.
OL,18,FLord Advocate Ruth Charteris KC said
OL,19,Fprotecting women and girls from abusive
OL,20,Fmen would be a clear priority during
OL,21,Fher time in office.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
