OL,3,GNEWSALord Advocate 'concerned' as
OL,4,Adomestic abuse charges rise by 14%
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt follows several high-profile cases
OL,7,Fin Scotland, including that of Stacy
OL,8,FHunter who was murdered by her husband
OL,9,Fwhile he was out on bail for allegedly
OL,10,Fstrangling her.
